    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52b1fb92111686ea9d710040",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "橡树、麻栎、柞树——\n山上的朋友们都非常的健谈。\n能和我一起，倾听它们的话语吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e362293fdf6a0e4561fa539bad0a4e01ed8c242ef8e7652925ca18b155421aaf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
