    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f504741d96f8ad7edee59eb4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "足以为我对你的感激之情做注解的事物——\n我想，恐怕只有在船桥才能找到了。\n请收下这份，我的双腿收集起来的信赖的见证吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25dc9f08db7d225718ba51f95205afdb78354ff07f1f13db2037bf5b2968818",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
