    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1313b9d1ea0ba650dadcda2f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不快点吃掉的话，我可就要偷吃掉咯～\n……噗哈，一点都不信任我呀～不会偷吃的啦！\n毕竟——这已经是属于训练亲的东西了嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f4fbe1d8aec82fa382f1fdbdbd126635839b3227738c8396152d8faf321e7c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
